WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
I really hope that in my lifetime

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,030
Can you take a look at this legendary top-quality spiritual grass?

3
00:00:05,030 --> 00:00:07,830
I'll let you see it when I get a chance

4
00:00:07,830 --> 00:00:14,910
Okay, then I'll look forward to it

5
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:18,070
Senior Brother Gu, what are you doing?

6
00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:22,320
Make a trap to catch the spirit beast that stole the spirit paper

7
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,720
What exactly is the medicine-stealing spirit beast you are talking about?

8
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:26,510
Very fast

9
00:00:26,510 --> 00:00:28,310
I encountered him several times and couldn’t see his appearance clearly.

10
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:30,310
Judging by his body shape, he is either a cat or a baby.

11
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:32,310
I told my senior brothers and no one believed me.

12
00:00:32,310 --> 00:00:34,610
They all think I'm lazy

13
00:00:34,610 --> 00:00:38,010
It's a pity that my natal spirit animal is the plant careless flower.

14
00:00:38,010 --> 00:00:40,020
Can't move at all

15
00:00:40,020 --> 00:00:42,020
So I've always had to rely on my people to chase me.

16
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:44,690
Let me help you catch it after the water is gone. Really?

17
00:00:44,690 --> 00:00:46,090
We'll meet for a while later

18
00:00:46,090 --> 00:00:48,790
Catching thieves is also my business

19
00:00:48,790 --> 00:00:50,590
I have experience hunting in the mountains since I was a child

20
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,590
It will definitely help

21
00:00:53,590 --> 00:00:55,990
Look, that one is here again

22
00:00:55,990 --> 00:00:57,790
That spiritual beast came to steal the spiritual grass again
